<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of April  4, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>					    April 4    WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  1,753  2,799   9,320</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				115    150	81</p>
<p>CCC					    1,727    827   1,306</p>
<p>TOTAL					  3,595  3,776  10,707</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 2,779   1,873    unq</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     237     241    unq</p>
<p>CCC					   2,658   3,558    unq</p>
<p>TOTAL					 5,674   5,672    unq</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
